propose a novel approach to building first-order integer-valued autoregressive (INAR (
1
)) models based on the concept of thinning. The standard approach requires that the thinning operator be defined first and INAR (
1
) models with either a specified marginal (the forward approach) or a specified innovation (the backward approach) are developed.
